<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>第9课 · 文件读写 —— 存档系统</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0d1021; --bg2:#141833; --card:#1a1f3d;
    --gold:#f5c542; --cyan:#4dd6ff; --purple:#a78bfa;
    --green:#4dd6ff; --pink:#f472b6; --orange:#fb923c;
    --red:#f87171; --text:#e8eaf6; --muted:#8b93b8; --line:#2a3060;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% -10%, rgba(77,214,255,.10), transparent),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 30% at 95% 90%, rgba(167,139,250,.08), transparent);
  }
  .wrap{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 20px 80px;}
  /* 头部 */
  .crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .crumb b{color:var(--cyan);}
  header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:34px;}
  .lesson-badge{
    display:inline-block;padding:4px 16px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.12);color:var(--cyan);border:1px solid rgba(77,214,255,.35);margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  h1{
    font-size:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#4dd6ff,#a78bfa 50%,#f5c542);
    -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
  }
  .subtitle{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;}
  .mission{
    margin-top:18px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 22px;text-align:left;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mission h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .mission li{margin-left:18px;}
  /* 板块 */
  section{
    background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;
    padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:26px;animation:fadeUp .6s ease both;
  }
  section:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.05s;}
  section h2{
    font-size:19px;margin-bottom:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .num{
    width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--purple));
    color:#0d1021;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-size:15px;font-weight:800;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  section p{margin-bottom:10px;}
  .hl{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
  .hl-c{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;}
  /* 代码块 */
  .code{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;
    font-size:14px;overflow-x:auto;margin:12px 0;position:relative;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .code .c{color:#5b648f;}   /* 注释 */
  .code .k{color:var(--pink);} /* 关键字/函数 */
  .code .s{color:#8be9fd;} /* 字符串 */
  .code .n{color:var(--orange);} /* 数字 */
  .code .v{color:var(--cyan);}  /* 变量 */
  .out{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:12px;
    padding:12px 18px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px;
    color:#a9ecff;margin-top:-4px;margin-bottom:12px;white-space:pre-wrap;
  }
  .out::before{content:"▶ 输出：";color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:2px;}
  /* 魔法盒子动画 */
  .boxes{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0;}
  .mbox{
    width:150px;background:var(--card);border:2px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:14px;
    padding:14px;text-align:center;position:relative;transition:all .3s;cursor:default;
  }
  .mbox:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.04);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(77,214,255,.25);}
  .mbox .tag{
    font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--cyan);
    background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;display:inline-block;
  }
  .mbox .val{
    font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0 4px;color:var(--gold);word-break:break-all;
  }
  .mbox .tip{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}
  .mbox.danger{border-color:var(--red);}
  .mbox.danger .tag{color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.1);}
  /* 警告框 */
  .warn-box{
    background:rgba(248,113,113,.08);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);border-radius:12px;
    padding:14px 18px;margin:14px 0;font-size:14px;
  }
  .warn-box b{color:var(--red);}
  /* 实验室 */
  .lab-input{
    display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0;align-items:center;
  }
  .lab-input input{
    flex:1;min-width:120px;background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:10px;
    padding:11px 16px;color:var(--text);font-size:15px;outline:none;
  }
  .lab-input input:focus{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(77,214,255,.18);}
  .btn{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cyan),var(--purple));color:#0d1021;border:none;
    padding:11px 22px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;
    transition:transform .15s, box-shadow .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(77,214,255,.3);}
  .btn-danger{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--red),var(--orange));}
  .btn-danger:hover{box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(248,113,113,.35);}
  .lab-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 4px;}
  .lab-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;}
  @media(max-width:720px){.lab-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;}
  .panel-title{font-size:13px;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:1px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;}
  .file-box{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;
    font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;min-height:84px;
  }
  .fline{padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;animation:lineIn .35s both;}
  .fline .ln{color:#3a4270;margin-right:8px;user-select:none;}
  .fline.new{background:rgba(77,214,255,.10);border-left:2px solid var(--gold);}
  .empty-file{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-style:italic;}
  .run-status{
    margin-top:12px;background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
    padding:10px 14px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;min-height:44px;
  }
  .run-status .step{animation:fadeIn .3s both;padding:2px 0;color:var(--text);}
  .run-status .step.warn{color:var(--red);}
  .run-status .step.ok{color:var(--cyan);}
  .hero-card{
    display:none;margin-top:16px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,#1d2448,#141833);
    border:2px solid var(--gold);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 26px;
    animation:popIn .45s cubic-bezier(.2,1.4,.4,1) both;
  }
  .hero-card.show{display:block;}
  .hero-card h3{color:var(--gold);font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .hero-card .attr{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0;}
  .hero-card .attr div{text-align:center;}
  .hero-card .attr b{font-size:26px;display:block;}
  .hero-card .attr span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}
  .hero-card .rarity{color:var(--purple);font-weight:700;}
  /* 预言机 */
  .oracle-q{
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;
    padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;
  }
  .oracle-q .qtitle{font-size:14px;color:var(--purple);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:600;}
  .oracle-opts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px;}
  .opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;color:var(--text);
    padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;
    transition:all .2s;
  }
  .opt:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .opt.right{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);color:var(--cyan);}
  .opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);color:var(--red);}
  .explain{
    display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);
    border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;
  }
  .explain.show{display:block;animation:fadeIn .4s;}
  /* 记忆卡片 */
  .cards-grid{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:16px;
  }
  .mcard{
    perspective:800px;height:130px;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .mcard-inner{
    position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .55s;
    transform-style:preserve-3d;
  }
  .mcard.flip .mcard-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg);}
  .mface{
    position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:13px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
    padding:12px;font-size:14px;
  }
  .mfront{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1d2448,#141833);border:1px solid var(--cyan);color:var(--cyan);font-weight:600;}
  .mback{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16284a,#101530);border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--text);transform:rotateY(180deg);font-size:13px;}
  .cards-tip{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;}
  /* Quiz */
  .quiz-q{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .quiz-q .qq{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;}
  .quiz-q .qq i{color:var(--gold);font-style:normal;margin-right:6px;}
  .qq-opts{display:grid;gap:8px;}
  .qq-opt{
    background:#0a0d1e;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;color:var(--text);
    padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;transition:all .2s;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .qq-opt:hover{border-color:var(--cyan);}
  .qq-opt.right{border-color:var(--green);background:rgba(77,214,255,.15);}
  .qq-opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);}
  .qq-exp{display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:12px;}
  .qq-exp.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result{
    display:none;margin-top:16px;text-align:center;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--gold);animation:popIn .4s both;
  }
  #quiz-result.show{display:block;}
  #quiz-result b{font-size:34px;color:var(--gold);display:block;}
  /* 课后任务 */
  .homework li{margin:8px 0 8px 18px;}
  .homework code{background:rgba(77,214,255,.1);color:var(--cyan);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;}
  footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px dashed var(--line);}
  @keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
  @keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
  @keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}
  @keyframes lineIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-10px);}to{opacity:1;transform:none;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <div class="crumb">◈ 装备库 · <b>第 9 课 / 共 26 课</b></div>

  <header>
    <div class="lesson-badge">STAGE 2 · ARMORY</div>
    <h1>文件读写 —— 存档系统</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">今日目标：让英雄的数据在程序关闭后依然存活</div>
    <div class="mission">
      <h3>📜 今日任务清单</h3>
      <li>理解「文件 = 程序的持久化背包」，学会 <span class="hl">with open(...)</span> 标准姿势</li>
      <li>分清读档三兄弟：<span class="hl">read / readline / readlines</span></li>
      <li>牢记 <span class="hl">"w" 会清空原文件</span> 的血泪警告，追加要用 <span class="hl">"a"</span></li>
      <li>养成写 <span class="hl">encoding="utf-8"</span> 的职业习惯，学会逐行读大文件</li>
      <li>通关实验室「模拟存档系统」+ 预言机 5 连 + Quiz ≥ 80 分</li>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- 1 open 与 with -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">1</span>open 与 with：给数据一个永久的家</h2>
    <p>之前学的变量有个致命弱点：<span class="hl">程序一关，内存清空</span>，辛苦练的英雄一夜回到解放前。想让数据活过关机？把它们写进<b>文件</b>——这就是「存档」。</p>
    <p>读写文件的第一步是 <span class="hl-c">open()</span>，它需要告诉 Python 三件事：打开哪个文件、用什么模式、用什么编码。</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">f</span> = <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"game_save.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"r"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>)
<span class="v">data</span> = <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">read</span>()      <span class="c"># 读取全部内容</span>
<span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">close</span>()          <span class="c"># 用完必须手动关门，忘了它就一直占着文件</span></div>

    <p>手动版的问题：<span class="hl">忘了写 close()</span>（新手十次有九次忘），或者代码中途出错根本走不到 close。所以 Python 送给所有玩家一件神器——<span class="hl-c">with</span>：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"game_save.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"r"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="v">data</span> = <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">read</span>()
<span class="c"># 缩进结束，文件自动关闭——哪怕中途出了错也会关</span></div>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">f</span>.closed)</div>
    <div class="out">True</div>

    <div class="boxes">
      <div class="mbox danger"><div class="tag">f = open(...)</div><div class="val">手动版</div><div class="tip">要自己写 f.close()，忘写就出事</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">with open(...) as f:</div><div class="val">推荐版</div><div class="tip">自动关门，出错也不怕</div></div>
    </div>
    <p>🧠 记忆口诀：<span class="hl">开门用 with，关门不用愁。</span>本课所有代码都用 with 写法。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 三种读法 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">2</span>读档三兄弟：read / readline / readlines</h2>
    <p>先用一个三行的存档文件做实验（下面代码会把它创建出来）：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"save.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"w"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">write</span>(<span class="s">"名字:阿呆\n等级:10\n金币:300\n"</span>)</div>

    <div class="boxes">
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">read()</div><div class="val">一个大字符串</div><div class="tip">整个文件一口吞下</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">readline()</div><div class="val">一行字符串</div><div class="tip">自带结尾 \n，再调读下一行</div></div>
      <div class="mbox"><div class="tag">readlines()</div><div class="val">字符串列表</div><div class="tip">每行一个元素（含 \n）</div></div>
    </div>

    <p>① <span class="hl-c">read()</span>：不分段，全部内容连成一个字符串（包括换行符 \n 本身）：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"save.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"r"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">read</span>())</div>
    <div class="out">名字:阿呆
等级:10
金币:300</div>

    <p>② <span class="hl-c">readline()</span>：像用吸管喝，一次只喝一行。返回的字符串<b>自带结尾的 \n</b>：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"save.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"r"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">readline</span>(), end=<span class="s">""</span>)  <span class="c"># 用 end="" 防止多出一个空行</span>
    <span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">readline</span>(), end=<span class="s">""</span>)  <span class="c"># 再调用一次，读的是第二行</span></div>
    <div class="out">名字:阿呆
等级:10</div>

    <p>③ <span class="hl-c">readlines()</span>：把每一行装进列表，方便用下标和 for 循环处理：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"save.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"r"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="v">lines</span> = <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">readlines</span>()   <span class="c"># 注意：返回的是列表！</span>
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">lines</span>)
<span class="k">print</span>(<span class="v">lines</span>[<span class="n">1</span>])</div>
    <div class="out">['名字:阿呆\n', '等级:10\n', '金币:300\n']
等级:10</div>
    <p>看清楚：列表里每个元素都<b>带着 \n</b>，处理时通常要 <code class="hl-c">strip()</code> 掉。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 写入与 w 警告 -->
  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">3</span>写入江湖：write / writelines 与 "w" 血泪警告</h2>
    <p>写入用 <span class="hl-c">write()</span>。第一个坑马上就来——<span class="hl">write 不自动换行</span>：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"log.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"w"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">write</span>(<span class="s">"第1行"</span>)
    <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">write</span>(<span class="s">"第2行"</span>)
<span class="c"># log.txt 的内容：第1行第2行 —— 挤在一起！</span></div>
    <p>想换行？自己动手：<code class="hl-c">f.write("第1行\n")</code>。要一次写多行，用 <span class="hl-c">writelines(列表)</span>（\n 依然要自己带）：</p>
    <div class="code"><span class="v">logs</span> = [<span class="s">"击杀了史莱姆\n"</span>, <span class="s">"拾获了草药\n"</span>, <span class="s">"升到了 2 级\n"</span>]
<span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"log.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"w"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
    <span class="v">f</span>.<span class="k">writelines</span>(<span class="v">logs</span>)</div>

    <div class="warn-box">⚠️ <b>血泪警告：用 "w" 打开一个已有内容的文件，原内容会在打开的瞬间被清空！</b>多少英雄的日记、配置、存档葬身于此。文件不存在时 "w" 会新建，这很贴心；但文件存在时它就是个无情的粉碎机。</div>
    <div class="code"><span class="k">with</span> <span class="k">open</span>(<span class="s">"diary.txt"</span>, <span class="s">"w"</span>, encoding=<span class="s">"utf-8"</span>) <span class="k">as</span> <span class="v">f</span>:
